    "created_at": "2023-02-23T07:13:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-23T07:13:17Z",
    "body": "I missed that the rationale here was the original URI RFC. Since that's been obsoleted by something that has much less restrictions I think the cat's out of the bag with respect to interoperability issues.\r\n\r\nIf this came as a recommendation from the IETF or ICANN community it would be something we should strongly consider, but as-is I don't think this is workable.",
